{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"DRUPAL-CONTRIB-2026-218","published":"2026-10-14T17:26:14Z","modified":"2026-10-14T18:00:02.946186491Z","aliases":["CVE-2026-108099"],"details":"The Entity List module provides a way to create lists of entities without Views.\n\nThe module has a remote code execution vulnerability.\n\nThe vulnerability is not directly exploitable with the module alone, but multiple serious exploit paths exist with other contributed modules. At least one known exploit path does not require authentication. Custom code may also expose the vulnerable functionality.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"drupal/entity_list","ecosystem":"Packagist:https://packages.drupal.org/8","purl":"pkg:composer/drupal/entity_list?repository_url=https:%2F%2Fpackages.drupal.org%2F8"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.0.10"}],"database_specific":{"constraint":"<3.0.10"}}],"database_specific":{"affected_versions":"<3.0.10","source":"https://github.com/DrupalSecurityTeam/drupal-advisory-database/blob/main/advisories/entity_list/DRUPAL-CONTRIB-2026-218.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.drupal.org/sa-contrib-2026-218"}],"credits":[{"name":"Dave Long (longwave)","contact":["https://www.drupal.org/u/longwave"]},{"name":"Drew Webber (mcdruid)","contact":["https://www.drupal.org/u/mcdruid"]},{"name":"Lee Rowlands (larowlan)","contact":["https://www.drupal.org/u/larowlan"]},{"name":"Octavio Galland (ogalland-tob)","contact":["https://www.drupal.org/u/ogalland-tob"]}]}